  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Reintegration of the Sri Lankan Refugee Returnees from India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall project objective is to facilitate the sustainable reintegration of Sri Lankan refugees returning from Tamil Nadu in 2023. Based on anticipated figures provided by UNHCR for 2023, the project will reach a maximum of 270 refugee returnees. The assistance will comprise the following: protection monitoring and provision of mental health and psychosocial support (MHPSS) for refugee returnees</narrative>
  </description>
